# NOTE: Reference/ (the licensed Pofo template) lives OUTSIDE this repo, one
# level up in the workspace folder. It is unreachable from here by design —
# there is no ignore rule to accidentally break, and no way for `git add -f`
# to pull it in. Do not copy it into the repo.

